## Features
- [#39](https://github.com/openDAQ/OpcUaModules/pull/39) Carry the function block type options `AlwaysEmptyInput`, `Singleton` and `CommonSettingsTypeId` over OPC UA.

- [#22](https://github.com/openDAQ/OpcUaModules/pull/22) Ignore calls to `updateOperationMode` on OPC UA client side.

- [#20](https://github.com/openDAQ/OpcUaModules/pull/20) Support advertising servers via OpcUa with discovery toggling

## Bug fixes

- [#9](https://github.com/openDAQ/OpcUaModules/pull/9) Fix appending dependent boost components.

